WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.950
What it reads, and what it sends.
ToBeBestMe runs inside Claude Code, on your computer.

2
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:11.200
It reads Claude Code’s own records.
All of it on your computer.

3
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:18.450
It sends only to Claude, through your account.
And to your phone, only if you set that up.

4
00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:22.100
It never opens .env or key files.
No analytics, no tracking, no server of ours. SECURITY.md lists everything it reads and writes.

5
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:25.000
ToBeBestMe
github.com/vradulthub-cloud/tobebestme
